WRITE ATOMICITY:
http://www.cs.umd.edu/~pugh/java/memoryModel/archive/0816.html
my writes visible first to 
   -> me 
   -> some
   -> all


WRITE SERIALIZABILITY:
http://www.cs.umd.edu/~pugh/java/memoryModel/archive/0823.html
writes to same cacheline seen by all processors in same order


write termination
http://www.cs.umd.edu/~pugh/java/memoryModel/archive/0823.html
Writes from me seen by
   -> me
   -> any


